  "question": {
    "text": "When <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>MnO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> is fused with <math> <mrow> <mtext>KOH</mtext></mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>KNO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math>, a coloured compound is formed. Choose the right compound with the appropriate colour."
